                "title": "Confirmed fraud and false alarms per simulated hour",
                "showDescription": true,
                "description": "How to read it: Each bar is one simulated hour, split into confirmed fraud and false alarms. Only hours whose verdicts are in have a bar; newer hours are waiting for verdicts (3 days)."
              },
              "encodings": {
